<title>HONG KONG: Trading in Leung Kee shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Leung Kee shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of construction concern Leung Kee Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Friday.  </p>
<p>Leung Kee shares ended HK$0.005 up at HK$0.31 on Thursday. Volume was 49.07 million shares worth HK$15.24 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
